{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 3979, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 2979, "text": "Darn."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 6720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5720, "text": "Double darn."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 8580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 6980, "text": "I love it when she talks dirty."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 12360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 11360, "text": "Mind if I try?"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 14020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12460, "text": "I'm good at spacial relationships."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 21780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 19540, "text": "Oh, no, I've really screwed it up."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 26760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23280, "text": "Is it just me, or is the resemblance\nuncanny?"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 34540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33480, "text": "slinky shoes in years."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 36920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 35020, "text": "I was six when I got my first pair."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 39200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 37620, "text": "Seven when we bought the new ceiling."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 43440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 41100, "text": "Boy, you seem awfully chipper today,\nsir."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 47080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 43680, "text": "Well, it's hard to deny the spring in my\nstep, ain't it, Mac Muffin?"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 50800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49280, "text": "What'd you do? Win the lottery?"}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 54380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 51280, "text": "Better. Mel Torme finally signed your\nadoption paper?"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 59720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 55940, "text": "Those bean counters in accounting have\nseen fit to grant my request for a"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 60720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 59720, "text": "personal assistant."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 65560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 62960, "text": "Now you can have help with your stuff."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 69960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66620, "text": "Right. Someone to handle the filing and\nthe correspondence. Somebody to do the"}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 70818, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 69960, "text": "case research."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 73560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 70820, "text": "Someone to scrape the scum off your sea\nmonkey bones."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 78900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 75100, "text": "Hey, there are no small jobs, only small\npeople."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 80140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 79140, "text": "Hello."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 83640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82240, "text": "As if by example."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 91300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90280, "text": "Problem, Dan?"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 93840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92840, "text": "Women."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 99600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 95620, "text": "So who was it last night? The Soviet\ngymnast? The farmer's daughter?"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 103120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 100160, "text": "One of those rubber -jointed ladies from\nthe freak shows who like to be"}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 106220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 103120, "text": "handcuffed and twirled around by their\nponytails screaming for mercy till they"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 107220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 106220, "text": "black out?"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 113100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 112100, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 117080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 114360, "text": "I'll have you know I spent last evening\nin the company of a lady."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 119360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 117560, "text": "What's the matter? Her owner whiffle\nfor?"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 128169, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 122350, "text": "Rita was perfect, intelligent, bright, a\nwonderful conversationalist. So what's"}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 128989, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 128169, "text": "the problem?"}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 129990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 128990, "text": "Damn!"}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 187040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 186040, "text": "Let's face it, Harry."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 189500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 188280, "text": "I'm all washed up."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 192980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 191900, "text": "Come on, Dan."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 195420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 193180, "text": "So you... Say it."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 202040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 199180, "text": "You... Come on, man. Say it."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 206780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 204160, "text": "You had a little trouble launching the\nold love boat."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 212620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 210500, "text": "You're talking stuck in dry dock, Harry."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 216850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 215850, "text": "Have you seen a doctor?"}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 218970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 217110, "text": "Yeah, on my way in, he ran some tests."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 221290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 220150, "text": "He said it was probably tension."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 224150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 222210, "text": "I have been worrying about that job\ninterview lately."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 227190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 224630, "text": "Well, yeah, I forgot about that. Have\nyou heard back from those people?"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 229130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227190, "text": "night, I'm supposed to have dinner with\none of the senior partners."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 231510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 229650, "text": "Well, that's probably it. Come on, Dan."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 233590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 231890, "text": "You can't let this get to you."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 238350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 234010, "text": "Come on. Every red -blooded American\nmale has had to face this problem at one"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 239710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238350, "text": "time or another in his life."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 242270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 240190, "text": "Has it ever happened to you? Hell no."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 247080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245960, "text": "You guys ready to do it?"}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 248660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 247400, "text": "Some more than others."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 256600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 253180, "text": "You know, I'm really glad that my\npersonal life is now everybody's"}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 260800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 257120, "text": "Hey, don't get testy with me just\nbecause your Dow Jones average hit us"}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 267780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 264000, "text": "Dan, you know, there are several books\nwritten on this subject that might be of"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 268780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 267780, "text": "some help to you."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 270120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269120, "text": "Such as?"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 273980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 270880, "text": "Well, The Little Engine That Could."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 282790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279370, "text": "Happens to every guy sooner or later.\nHas it ever happened to you? Hell no!"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 286970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285930, "text": "Excuse me."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 289670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 288670, "text": "Hell no!"}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 294210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 291710, "text": "Pardon me, sir. Your new assistant is\nhere."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 295450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294450, "text": "Oh!"}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 297530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296510, "text": "Am I in yet?"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 300630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299310, "text": "Harry, she's blind."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 303510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 301150, "text": "Ooh, who's the genius who figured that\nout?"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 305710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 304290, "text": "Like cane, glasses."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 307490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 305990, "text": "I think we got a real..."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 313990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 312650, "text": "This thing got a head on it?"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 318330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 317270, "text": "Hey, that's funny."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 323330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 319630, "text": "Hi, I'm Judge Harry Stone. I've really\nbeen looking forward to meeting you."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 325270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323810, "text": "Don't get out much, do you?"}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 331350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 326670, "text": "Hi, I'm Christine Sullivan, and I think\nit's inspiring to see someone overcome a"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 332350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331350, "text": "physical challenge."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 334630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 332630, "text": "Ooh, who's this? The missing Osmond?"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 339470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 336950, "text": "Risley on a moped is physically\nchallenged."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 341470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339870, "text": "Lady. I'm blind!"}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 346110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 342730, "text": "Want to know what it's like to live in\nthe dark?"}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 348870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 346570, "text": "There. How do you like it?"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 355730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 354530, "text": "Please, no more."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 359070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358070, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 362170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 359610, "text": "Now listen up, because I'm only going to\nsay this once."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 368550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 362570, "text": "My name is Joy Buscaglia. I touch type\n60 words a minute, take dictation from"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 372100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 368550, "text": "transcription, and I'm fast as... in the\nbuilding at the Xerox machine."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 374040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 372580, "text": "I don't have to close the lid."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 380480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 376540, "text": "Now we're going to have a few ground\nrules around here. One, we don't move"}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 381479, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380480, "text": "furniture around."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 383460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 381480, "text": "Two, no sneaking up on me."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 389040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383780, "text": "And three, I don't like chit -chat. Do\nnot ask how I am. I'm blind!"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 391420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 390280, "text": "That's how I am."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 393660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 392220, "text": "Oh, I'm also hungry."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 397240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394240, "text": "So if anybody wants me, I'll be on my\nbreak. Mac!"}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 400280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 399280, "text": "Take me to the cafeteria."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 402500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 400340, "text": "I want to sniff some entrees."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 408660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 407340, "text": "She seems nice."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 418900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 413560, "text": "Another senseless, flinky, shoe -related\naccident."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 423900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420520, "text": "Sir, may I ask you a question about Joy?"}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 425700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 424200, "text": "Sure. Can I kill her?"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 432180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 428360, "text": "I know she's a little abrasive, but...\nShe felt up my lunch, Harry."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 438920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 434160, "text": "She what? She wanted to know if the\ncorned beef was lean, so she pawed it."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 441600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 440060, "text": "Nobody gropes my Reuben."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 444360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442520, "text": "You're on Love Talk with Dr."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 445580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 444580, "text": "Lucy. Who's this?"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 449860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 445960, "text": "Hello, Dr. Lucy. This is Seymour from\nQueens."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 452060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450380, "text": "Yeah, I have a question."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 457870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 456870, "text": "About impotency?"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 460430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459430, "text": "Uh -oh."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 465990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 464670, "text": "Gotta go, Dr. Lucy."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 472130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470450, "text": "Sir, do you think Dan's going to be all\nright?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 475870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 472350, "text": "Well, he's getting advice from the\nfinest medical experts in the field."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 504180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 503180, "text": "him on his chest."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 508920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505720, "text": "Okay, who ordered the two dozen raw\noysters?"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 514240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 512400, "text": "Thanks for keeping this under your hats."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 517020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514760, "text": "At least we've got something under ours."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 520419, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 519419, "text": "Oh, Joy."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 521558, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 520600, "text": "Judge Stone."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 523500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 521559, "text": "Just the man I was groping for."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 526820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523960, "text": "This chunk has got to go if I'm going to\nbe working here."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 531040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 527180, "text": "Are you referring to my trinkets? I'm\nreferring to your crap."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 534500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 533360, "text": "Your phone messages."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 535720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 534720, "text": "Oh, thank you."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 540500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 537860, "text": "Uh, excuse me, these are in Braille."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 544020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541880, "text": "Your father wants to know why you're\navoiding them."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 548020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544700, "text": "Your singles club canceled the hayride\nbecause everybody else thought it was"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 549020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 548020, "text": "stupid."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 554380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550180, "text": "And some twerp named Rod phoned and said\nhe can't wait to see his lamby cakes"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 555960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 554380, "text": "for some smoochy pies."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 558360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 557360, "text": "Gee, thanks."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 564170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 561230, "text": "Yeah, your doctor phoned and said your\ntests came out negative."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 565450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 564370, "text": "Are you sure?"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 568250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 565670, "text": "Hey, it's a poor musician who blames his\ninstrument."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 575330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 571710, "text": "Come on, Porcupine. We got more sunshine\nto spread."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 577110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 576110, "text": "Porcupine!"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 582290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 579730, "text": "The blind leading the blank."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 588450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 587450, "text": "Hello?"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 593970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592970, "text": "Corbin."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 597290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594370, "text": "From Corbin, Fulton, and Nordoff, you\napplied for a job with us."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 598930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597930, "text": "Oh, yeah."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 602770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 599010, "text": "Hi. That wasn't your fault. You never\nknow when you're going to get a bad one."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 604149, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603230, "text": "Bad oyster."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 605730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604150, "text": "Bad, bad, bad oyster."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 607870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606870, "text": "Ah, well."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 611130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608250, "text": "I picked a very nice restaurant nearby\nhere for the interview."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 613770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 611690, "text": "Actually, I'd rather conduct the\ninterview at my office."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 615610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 614150, "text": "Oh, yeah, sure, sure. No problem.\nWhatever."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 617150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 616010, "text": "I've already had dinner."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 620870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 618090, "text": "I can't wait to show you my list of\nreferences."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 622660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 621660, "text": "That won't be necessary."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 627760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 624120, "text": "Not necessary? Am I still being\nconsidered for the position?"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 632280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 628280, "text": "Oh, I'd say you're being considered for\nseveral positions."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 639420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637900, "text": "Are you all right?"}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 640660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 639660, "text": "Oh, fine."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 643260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 641320, "text": "Oh, the silly goose that I am."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 648220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 643760, "text": "It sounded sort of like you were making\na sexual proposition."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 650840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649180, "text": "You're a quick study fielding."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 652500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 651500, "text": "I are?"}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 655460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 654160, "text": "That's a point in your favor."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 657820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 656300, "text": "Meet me here in 20 minutes."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 662580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 658800, "text": "And be ready to show me some class\naction."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 682100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 681100, "text": "He's a psychologist."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 683560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 682220, "text": "Is that corned beef?"}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 686680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 684000, "text": "Everybody just keep your damn heads off\nmy sandwich."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 693760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 691260, "text": "It's been a tough day for Roz and her\nlunch meat."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 698520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 694800, "text": "Doc, I want to talk to you about this\nblind girl. Now, I'm afraid I've got to"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 699520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 698520, "text": "fire her."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 704400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 699560, "text": "I hate to do it, but, hell, keeping her\non, that'd be like burning my face with"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 707680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704400, "text": "a huge disfiguring blowtorch and\npretending it don't hurt."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 713420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709100, "text": "To paraphrase Freud, we all feel just\nhorrible about it. Yay!"}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 714980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713840, "text": "I fixed the funky shoes!"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 716680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 715260, "text": "I fixed the funky shoes!"}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 719920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 718000, "text": "You must be very proud."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 723480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 721140, "text": "Look, Harry, didn't she do a nice job?"}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 725580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724500, "text": "Thanks, Miss Sullivan."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 728680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 726060, "text": "Did you talk to Joy's former supervisors\nyet?"}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 730100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 728940, "text": "Yes. And?"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 734340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730420, "text": "Well, so far, Joy's the girl most likely\nto be offered in a hostage swap."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 739620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736380, "text": "Oh, also, I found out... something\ninteresting. She's only been blind for"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 741280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 739620, "text": "years. Some sort of accident."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 742820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 741820, "text": "Aha."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 744240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 743240, "text": "Aha."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 747020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 745740, "text": "Aha what?"}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 750080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 747800, "text": "Sounds like a classic case of displaced\nanger."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 753640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 750620, "text": "I mean, this bitterness could just be a\nsymptom that she hasn't worked through"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 755060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 753640, "text": "the trauma of being robbed of her sight."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 757260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 755480, "text": "Well, how's she going to react to being\nfired?"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 759240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 757660, "text": "Oh, that depends on several factors."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 761500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 760500, "text": "Does she own a gun?"}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 775520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 773480, "text": "would do to have an office like this?"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 780160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 775900, "text": "Well, let's find out, shall we?"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 782460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 781460, "text": "Dealey Dan."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 787460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 786460, "text": "Look, a fireplace."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 788819, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787840, "text": "That's great."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 789860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 788820, "text": "And a refrigerator."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 792740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 790740, "text": "Keeps the hot side hot and the cold side\ncold."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 797960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 794760, "text": "Why aren't you over here on the hot\nside?"}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 801020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 798580, "text": "Believe me, most of me wants to be."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 805490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804490, "text": "What do you think?"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 810990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 806370, "text": "I think... I can see the Faranzano\nBridge from here."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 814630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811650, "text": "You know, that is the longest single\nspan in the world."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 815990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814930, "text": "Dan, come."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 822690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 819890, "text": "I want you to make windows rattle in New\nJersey."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 826610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 824930, "text": "Okay, be back in an hour."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 829450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 826930, "text": "Dan! Wait, wait, hold it. Look."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 832830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830670, "text": "I can't explain it now, but..."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 837820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 833420, "text": "There's something about me that's a\nlittle off."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 843120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 839340, "text": "Say, you aren't one of those sickos you\nhear on the radio call -in shows."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 844360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 843360, "text": "Oh, no, no, no, no."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 846420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845080, "text": "Not me."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 850800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 847140, "text": "It's just that I would really like to\ndiscuss the job."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 855460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851280, "text": "And I'd like to discuss that story I\nheard about you and the stewardesses on"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 856720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 855460, "text": "baggage carousel."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 859680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857000, "text": "Oh, that was just a little..."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 864080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 863080, "text": "My resume."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 868400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 865000, "text": "You want to talk resumes. Others are\nmuch more qualified than you."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 871780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 868640, "text": "I know that, but... Wait a minute."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 873880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 872480, "text": "Who's more qualified than I am?"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 875980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 874980, "text": "Everybody."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 881980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 877540, "text": "Hold it a second. Wait a... You're\ntelling me that my skills as an attorney"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 883280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 881980, "text": "nothing to do with me being here?"}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 885120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 884120, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 889080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 886300, "text": "Now help me get this thing off. Whoa,\nwhoa, whoa. Put it back in neutral a"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 890080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 889080, "text": "second, sister."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 892980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 891980, "text": "You know what?"}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 898340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894200, "text": "You want to call me in here, play your\nlittle bedroom games, take shots at my"}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 899340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 898340, "text": "manhood?"}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 901620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 900620, "text": "That's fine."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 903840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901800, "text": "I get that all the time."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 908600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905160, "text": "All right, listen, I will admit that I\ncouldn't afford some snooty Ivy League"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 909600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908600, "text": "education."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 914740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910440, "text": "You know, but when you get your degree\nfrom the Bayou Academy of Law and"}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 918440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914740, "text": "Agriculture, you'll learn something\nmore."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 920520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 918720, "text": "A fighting sow belly."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 924879, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 924040, "text": "What he wants."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 927240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 924880, "text": "Can't be afraid to get your snout dirty."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 930500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 928180, "text": "You know what? I live the law every day."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 934200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 931340, "text": "The courthouses and the jails of New\nYork City."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 938240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 935320, "text": "I may have barf in my cups when I get\nhome at night."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 942240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 940360, "text": "But that's the way I like it."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 946580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 943000, "text": "That's why I have the highest conviction\nrate of any DA in this city. And that's"}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 948840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 946580, "text": "why I have the lowest percentage of\noverturned cases."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 953320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 949180, "text": "And that's why you can say whatever you\nwant to about my manhood."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 958380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953900, "text": "But nobody, lady, nobody can touch Dan\nFielding in a court of law."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 961520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 959660, "text": "Or for that matter, anywhere else."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 968520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 962000, "text": "You mean... I mean, hold on to your\nDixie cups, babe. The salt shall rise"}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 976140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972420, "text": "You know what really gnaws at my gut,\nMiss Sullivan?"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 977440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976440, "text": "What's that, sir?"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 981480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977520, "text": "How am I going to fire Joy without just\ncompletely crushing her?"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 986330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 982670, "text": "Oh, I think she can handle it, sir. All\nright, she's a little crusty, but that"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 987770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 986330, "text": "doesn't mean that she doesn't have\nfeelings."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 991910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988870, "text": "I just heard the greatest bus crash\noutside."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 996510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993970, "text": "You're right, sir. She is a sensitive\nsoul."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 999850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 998570, "text": "Is that your cologne?"}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1002610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000070, "text": "Or are you delivering soap cakes to the\nurinals?"}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1006250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1005250, "text": "Good luck, sir."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1011910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007990, "text": "So? Uh, Joy, here, have a seat."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1019900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1017100, "text": "Joy, I've got something to say to you,\nand I'm afraid it's not going to be"}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1021280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1020280, "text": "Well, spit it out."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1024520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1023080, "text": "I'm afraid I've got to let you go."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1027219, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026440, "text": "You what?"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1029780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1027220, "text": "Now, I want you to know that your office\nskills are terrific."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1034020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1030079, "text": "I mean, the couple of days that you've\nbeen here, you've really gotten the"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1035020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1034020, "text": "organized."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1041240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1036880, "text": "My correspondence is all up to date, my\nfiles look great, and boy, I could bring"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1043220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1041240, "text": "down a charging rhino with one of these\npencils."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1049420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1045620, "text": "So I did a good job, and now you're\ngoing to fire me?"}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1052060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050020, "text": "It's not the job, Joy. It's your\nattitude."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1055080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1052560, "text": "Now, I know you've had a rough time of\nit. In fact, I've talked to a"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1058020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1055080, "text": "psychologist friend, and he's willing to\ntry to get you into his encounter"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1061840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1058020, "text": "group. If that's a burden on you\nfinancially, I'll help you out of my own"}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1066240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061840, "text": "pocket. My point is that even though\nthis didn't work out, if there's"}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1067920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066240, "text": "can do for you, I'm here."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1071760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1070380, "text": "I trashed your armadillo."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1076820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072480, "text": "What? You heard me? That armored rat of\nyours is now sucking swill in the bottom"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1077820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076820, "text": "of a dumpster."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1081720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1079760, "text": "Clarence? He's in a dumpster?"}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1086460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1082740, "text": "And he can take your encounter group and\nroll it into a ball and stick it in"}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1087580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1086460, "text": "your mail chute."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1089200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1088200, "text": "Clarence!"}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1091080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1089980, "text": "Pencil neck geek!"}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1094320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093320, "text": "Hello, Judge Stone."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1096140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1094780, "text": "I'm Cooper from Personnel."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1099180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1096360, "text": "Well, if it isn't the polyester\nPimpernel."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1101480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099740, "text": "My, aren't we cheery today."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1104290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102190, "text": "I have Miss Buscali's transfer papers."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1109010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104550, "text": "Hey, I'd love to stay and schmooze, but\nI can tell you two civic giants want to"}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1109889, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1109010, "text": "be alone."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1113150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1109890, "text": "Maybe you can rub your skulls together\nand come up with a thought or something."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1114810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1113810, "text": "You know,"}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1120130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117690, "text": "it's too bad we don't burn people at the\nstake anymore."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1125050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121970, "text": "Oh, I don't know. Maybe none of us can\nreally understand how that accident"}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1126250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125050, "text": "affected Joy emotionally."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1128270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1126750, "text": "Actually, it's made a big improvement."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1130810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1129770, "text": "I beg your pardon?"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1133910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1131230, "text": "Oh, before the accident, she was really\nobnoxious."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1136190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1135030, "text": "She's improved quite a bit."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1137430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1136430, "text": "How so?"}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1139790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1137810, "text": "Well, she stopped biting, for one."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1145710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1141690, "text": "Wait a minute. You're telling me that\nthat woman was born nasty?"}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1161090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1159030, "text": "I got rid..."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1169690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1162990, "text": "I've got... I've got... Who could ask\nfor anything"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1170690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1169690, "text": "more?"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1176310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171130, "text": "That was... That was... Volcanic."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1179810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1178530, "text": "We aim to please."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1182370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1180950, "text": "Toss me my other shoe."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1184590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182890, "text": "Do you believe it now?"}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1188740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185480, "text": "Yep, dinner break's over. Got places to\ngo. People to jail."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1191820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189600, "text": "It's going to be fabulous having you\naround."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1194720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192960, "text": "If the furniture holds up."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1198780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1197180, "text": "Alas, we will never know."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1200480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199480, "text": "What do you mean?"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1207540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201640, "text": "What I mean is... Good luck in finding a\nnew attorney."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1209880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208880, "text": "Ciao, baby."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1217760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1214440, "text": "You're turning down a six -figure salary\nand a boss who's willing to work with"}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1218760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1217760, "text": "you?"}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1220120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218800, "text": "Pro bono."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1226360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1222400, "text": "Well, you see, the point is, I didn't\nspend eight years in the DA's office"}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1230000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1226360, "text": "to become somebody's high -priced office\ngigolo."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1238800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1232360, "text": "Oh, and, um... When you think of this\nnight, and you"}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1243380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1238800, "text": "will... suffer."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1244950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1243950, "text": "Laughter."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1275480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1274480, "text": "little piece of rice?"}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1277960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1276040, "text": "Or a silly little maggot?"}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1283120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1281380, "text": "Definitely not Uncle Ben."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1286380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1284800, "text": "Sir? Yeah?"}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1291280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1287400, "text": "Is Joy... dead?"}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1295220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1293040, "text": "No, Roz. I had her reassigned."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1299640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298640, "text": "Hey, Dan."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1301340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1300180, "text": "Did you get the job?"}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1302680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1301680, "text": "Nope."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1306970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1305130, "text": "All the same, it would have been a shame\nto lose you."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1308190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1307190, "text": "Thank you, Harry."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1309470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1308470, "text": "What happened?"}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1312750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309810, "text": "The desks were cramped."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1324870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1317870, "text": "You know those disgusting animalistic\nurges I"}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1326190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1324870, "text": "used to torment you with?"}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1328850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1326850, "text": "Yes. They're back."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1335180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1333800, "text": "I'm taking Joy down to personnel."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1340620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1335480, "text": "Okay, well... I, uh... I know there's\nbeen some problems these past few days."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1345880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1340860, "text": "And there's been some misunderstandings.\nBut just to leave on the right note..."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1350520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1345880, "text": "How do I do it?"}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1353600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1352080, "text": "So, Curly, dinner tomorrow?"}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1354800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1353800, "text": "My place?"}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1356600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1355280, "text": "You bet. What should I wear?"}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1358140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1356820, "text": "I'm blind, remember?"}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1360440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1358420, "text": "Wear a car cover for all I care."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1366930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1365930, "text": "Are you dating Joy?"}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1368029, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1367090, "text": "Uh -huh."}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1372990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1368030, "text": "Well, I don't mean to be a Budinsky, but\nare you sure it's not just pity?"}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1375110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1374110, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1377090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1375490, "text": "I think she really likes me."}
